  "description": "VOGYEY crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H120 Ho4 N12 O16,C2 H6 O1,C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho1A (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho2A (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho3A (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho4A (Ho) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.507-3.828 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.91-112.47°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C132H129Ho4N13O17. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
